(1742, 502, 'Server Settings', '[{\"raw\": \"PvP Players may attack other players. Account Type Basic and Premium Theft Yes. Players can steal items. Deeds Settlements can be placed anywhere. Guard Towers Optional Artifacts No, artifacts do not spawn. Allowed Faiths Vynora, Fo, Magranon, Libila Spy Protection Enabled. The same IP cannot log into two different kingdoms. Skill gain Double The Curve Enabled Scenarios Enabled\"}]', '<td>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/index.php/PvP\" title=\"PvP\">PvP</a></dt>\n<dd>Players may attack other players.</dd>\n<dt>Account Type</dt>\n<dd>Basic and Premium</dd>\n<dt>Theft</dt>\n<dd>Yes. Players can <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Steal\" title=\"Steal\">steal</a> items.</dd>\n<dt>Deeds</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Settlements\" title=\"Settlements\">Settlements</a> can be placed anywhere.</dd>\n<dt>Guard Towers</dt>\n<dd>Optional</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Artifacts</dt>\n<dd>No, <a href=\"/index.php/Locate_artifact#List_of_artifacts\" title=\"Locate artifact\">artifacts</a> do not spawn.</dd>\n<dt>Allowed Faiths</dt>\n<dd>Vynora, Fo, Magranon, Libila </dd>\n<dt>Spy Protection</dt>\n<dd>Enabled. The same IP cannot log into two different kingdoms.</dd>\n<dt>Skill gain</dt>\n<dd>Double </dd>\n<dt>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Curve\" title=\"Curve\">Curve</a></dt>\n<dd>Enabled</dd>\n<dt>Scenarios</dt>\n<dd>Enabled </dd></dl>\n</td>'),
