(1867, 550, 'General Information', '[{\"raw\": \"Genesis : May 31st, 2012 Tiles : 2048x2048 Twitter : @WO_Celebration MRTG : Freedom004 Forum : Celebration\"}]', '<td>\n<p><b>Genesis</b>: May 31st, 2012<br/>\n<b>Tiles</b>: 2048x2048<br/>\n<b>Twitter</b>: <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://twitter.com/WO_Celebration\" rel=\"nofollow\">@WO_Celebration</a><br/>\n<b>MRTG</b>: <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://Freedom004.game.wurmonline.com/mrtg/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Freedom004</a><br/>\n<b>Forum</b>: <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/forum/92-celebration/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Celebration</a>\n</p>\n</td>'),
