teel_lump\" title=\"Glimmersteel lump\">glimmersteel lump</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Seryll_lump\" title=\"Seryll lump\">seryll lump</a>, or <a href=\"/index.php/Steel_lump\" title=\"Steel lump\">steel lump</a> (0.69 kg).</li><li>Right-click <a href=\"/index.php/Small_anvil\" title=\"Small anvil\">small anvil</a></li>\n<li>Open submenu \"Create &gt; <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Writing\" title=\"Writing\">Writing</a>\"</li>\n</ul>\n</td>'),
