(7353, 2390, 'Server Settings', '[{\"raw\": \"PvE Players may only duel or spar consenting players. Account Type Basic and Premium Theft No. Players cannot steal items that are secured. Deeds Settlements can not be placed on this server. Guard Towers Optional Artifacts No, artifacts do not spawn. Allowed Faiths Fo, Magranon, Vynora, Libila Priests Priesthood is not possible Skills Capped at 30\"}]', '<td>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/index.php/PvE\" title=\"PvE\">PvE</a></dt>\n<dd>Players may only duel or spar consenting players.</dd>\n<dt>Account Type</dt>\n<dd>Basic and Premium</dd>\n<dt>Theft</dt>\n<dd>No. Players cannot <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Steal\" title=\"Steal\">steal</a> items that are secured.</dd>\n<dt>Deeds</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Settlements\" title=\"Settlements\">Settlements</a> can not be placed on this server.</dd>\n<dt>Guard Towers</dt>\n<dd>Optional</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Artifacts</dt>\n<dd>No, <a href=\"/index.php/Locate_artifact#List_of_artifacts\" title=\"Locate artifact\">artifacts</a> do not spawn.</dd>\n<dt>Allowed Faiths</dt>\n<dd>Fo, Magranon, Vynora, Libila</dd>\n<dt>Priests</dt>\n<dd>Priesthood is not possible  </dd>\n<dt>Skills</dt>\n<dd>Capped at 30   </dd></dl>\n</td>'),
